  <ScenTitle>Sinking a Battlewagon, 1990</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;-With the construction of the Kirov battlecruisers, the US Navy once again faces armored, large enemy combatants. This experiment, with an Iowa as the target, is to see the effectiveness of submarine weapons against such targets.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-Scenario by Coiler12&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
